To guarantee that all frames are forwarded onto the correct pseudowire and to the correct customer and attachment circuits, it is imperative that the correct VC ID is configured for each attachment circuit."
      solution    : "Assign globally unique VC IDs for each virtual circuit and configure the attachment circuits with the appropriate VC ID.

R5(config)#int g0/1
R5(config-if)#xconnect x.2.2.12 55 encapsulation mpls"
      reference   : "800-53|CP-8,800-53r5|SC-47,CAT|I,CCI|CCI-004931,CSF|ID.BE-4,CSF|PR.PT-4,CSF2.0|PR.IR-04,GDPR|32.1.b,GDPR|32.1.c,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(a)(2)(ii),ISO-27001-2022|A.5.29,ISO-27001-2022|A.7.11,ITSG-33|CP-8,ITSG-33|CP-8a.,LEVEL|1M,NESA|T2.2.4,NESA|T4.5.1,QCSC-v1|5.2.1,Rule-ID|SV-216705r991900_rule,STIG-ID|CISC-RT-000670,Vuln-ID|V-216705"
      see_also    : "https://workbench.cisecurity.org/benchmarks/26261"
    </report>
  </else>
